This work is based on the Dungeon Crawler Carl Roleplaying Game created by Renegade Game Studios, which is based on the Dungeon Crawler Carl book series by Matt Dinniman. I do not own this material, and all rights belong to the original creators. It is not officially endorsed by or affiliated with Renegade Game Studios or Matt Dinniman.

This is a fan work created for personal use and shared for educational and non-commercial purposes only. The intent is to provide a tool for groups using the Dungeon Crawler Carl RPG system, not to compete with or replace the official product.
